### Ignore auto generated files
frontend/node_modules/
### The whole data directory, not just the JSON files directly in it. The old pattern
### "frontend/src/data/timestamps/*." ended in a dot and therefore matched nothing, so
### every timestamp file from the build machine was baked into the published image.
### main.py runs before "npm install"/"npm start" in entrypoint.py and recreates the
### directory, so nothing in the image needs it.
frontend/src/data/
logs/
### Runtime state: the previous-good snapshots and the append-only history store. Baking a
### build machine's copy into the image would ship someone else's league as history, and the
### mount would then shadow it anyway.
data/